You get into your unsafe refuge. It is almost completely dark around; you can see no further than at arm's length. The night jungle is full of life. Somebody bustles about in the trees; you can hear weird rustles and sighs coming from the thicket.
Suddenly, forest animals begin to scream especially loudly. You can hear some small, rapid animals climbing up the trees. It seems that a large predator is approaching. You do your best to discern something in the darkness, but in vain. Besides, it is getting quiet outside...